 of enemy weaknesses, while the equipment and skill choices add depth for players who want to build their character. The mix of puzzles and RPG progression is meant to balance two genres rather than favour one. CrossCode is single-player with full controller support, and it suits fans of SNES-era action RPGs who like fast-paced combat."}}